dbVisuals bundles third-party JavaScript in two prebuilt browser applications.
The R code and the dbVisuals sources are MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). The
bundled components keep their own licences, all permissive, listed below.

Sources of the minified bundles
-------------------------------

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/mosaic_gl/mosaic_gl-bundle.js
  The mosaic_gl() viewer. Its source ships with the package in
  inst/viewer-src/ (package.json and package-lock.json pin every dependency);
  `npm ci && npm run build` in that directory reproduces the bundle.

inst/sqlrooms/
  The SQL Rooms Canvas web application served by launchBrowser(). It is
  built from frontend/sqlrooms-ai/ in the package's source repository,
  https://github.com/dbverse-org/dbVisuals, where package.json and
  package-lock.json pin every dependency.

